contentText:
A collection of artists and public figures are speaking out after Macklemore &#8216;s removal from Ed Sheeran &#8216;s U.S. tour.

Following the rapper revealing Monday (Sept. 14) that he had been dropped from the remainder of Sheeran&#8217;s Loop Tour following his repeated onstage calls to &#8220;Free Palestine,&#8221; a number of people have rallied behind him.

